  "details": "The copyright footer at the bottom of the https://hello.vrchat.com/ website is out of date. \n\nIt currently reads \"Copyright © 2025 VRChat Inc.\" (see screenshot)\n\nAccording to the sitemap, 5 pages including \"/legal\", \"/vrchatplus\", and \"/avatar-marketplace\" have all received 2026 updates (with lastmod dates in Jan / Feb 2026).\n\nVRChat's legal terms of service (TOS) page states \"Effective Date: February 9, 2026\".\n\nhttps://hello.vrchat.com/legal\n\nThese updates to the site are likely significant enough to justify updating the copyright in the footer.\n\nHave a nice day :3!",
